<title>UK: UK gilt auction result -- full results.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction result -- full results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following auction results were</p>
<p>announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT:2.5 BLN</p>
<p>COUPON:7.25 PCT</p>
<p>MATURITY:2007</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD:7.57 PCT</p>
<p>BID AMOUNT/COVER:2.17 TIMES</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE:97-18  </p>
<p>NOTES: The yield tail was one basis point and the price tail 4/32.</p>
</text>
